{
 "summary": "Fixed OrderedMultiDict/QueryParamDict == dict ignoring values. In OrderedMultiDict.__eq__ (boltons/dictutils.py) and its vendored copy used by QueryParamDict (boltons/urlutils.py), the plain-mapping branch computed 'other[selfk] == self[selfk]' as a discarded no-op statement, so any dict with matching keys compared equal regardless of values. Changed it to 'if other[selfk] != self[selfk]: return False' so a single differing value makes == return False while matching keys/values still compare True. All 422 project tests pass."
